WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.033
Step eight. The seller or lender view.

2
00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:11.848
Sellers and lenders get their own view. Every agreement is listed with its asset, here a boat, its status, and the yield received.

3
00:00:11.848 --> 00:00:19.568
Open an agreement to see the terms, payments, sweeps and the lien status, read live from testnet.

4
00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:27.794
The payout ledger lists every sweep and payment from on-chain events, with a link to each transaction.

5
00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:33.451
And Invite a buyer lets you pick the asset type, set starting numbers, and share a link.

